# Round 18, C3-2 (follows). L §2.5: "Two top-level items with one id are refused (LOAD-DUP), but two scenarios over one
# base never meet, so each may declare an id the other declares (§6.4)". sa and sb each declare input bonus.
=== base.tally
model base
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input pay: money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 10.00 PLN

ask qb: pay
=== sa.tally
scenario sa over base
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

input bonus: money PLN

version va
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-06-01
  bonus = 1.00 PLN

ask qa: bonus in sa
=== sb.tally
scenario sb over base
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

input bonus: money PLN

version vb
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-06-01
  bonus = 2.00 PLN

ask qs: bonus in sb
=== expect
qa: 1.00 PLN
  world: sa
